Where preservation is impossible, migration guidance SHALL be provided.

16. Constitutional Governance

The Atlas Policy Specification SHALL be governed by a Constitutional Governance Authority responsible for:

Approving constitutional amendments.
Maintaining semantic integrity.
Resolving specification disputes.
Publishing official revisions.
Preserving historical editions.
Coordinating international governance.

The authority SHALL operate transparently and maintain complete public records of constitutional decisions.

